tasks.brief:
Rewrite src/api/chat.py: Import stream_reply and FALLBACK_REPLY from src.services.llm. Define FastAPI APIRouter. Define POST /api/v1/chat endpoint accepting ChatRequest body (message: str). Call stream_reply(request.message) and wrap in StreamingResponse with SSE framing. Iterate stream_reply output: for ("token", content) yield bytes 'event: token
data: {"content": "<content>"}

'. For ("done",) yield bytes 'event: done
data: {}

'. For ("error",) yield bytes 'event: error
data: {"message": "<FALLBACK_REPLY>"}

'. Acceptance: POST /api/v1/chat with {"message": "test"} returns 200 with content-type text/event-stream; missing message returns 422 before handler runs; SSE token events in order; done event after tokens; error event with FALLBACK_REPLY message on failure; exactly one terminal event per request.
